{% comment %}
  Cadastro em 2 passos (Profissional da Estética / Cliente Final), inspirado em
  tulipia.com.br/register. Passo 1 escolhe o perfil, passo 2 coleta os dados da conta.
  A criação da conta e o setup B2B (só pra "profissional") acontecem via JS
  (assets/studio3-register.js) — ver esse arquivo pra entender o fluxo completo.
  URL do Worker fica em branco até o deploy (ver Studio3-B2B-Worker/README.md); até lá o
  cadastro cria a conta normalmente, só sem o catálogo profissional atribuído ainda.

  Visual em 2 painéis (protótipo aprovado pelo cliente, ver CLAUDE.md): painel de marca
  à esquerda (fundo escuro, degradê com os azuis da paleta 07) + formulário à direita,
  full-bleed (sem o header mínimo que existia antes em layout/cadastro.liquid — a logo
  agora mora dentro do painel de marca). No mobile, o painel de marca vira um hero curto
  no topo e o formulário sobe por cima dele como uma "folha" branca arredondada (em vez
  de só encolher o painel de marca pra uma tarja fina, que ficava quase igual ao layout
  antigo — foi o motivo do primeiro protótipo mobile ser reprovado).
{% endcomment %}

{%- style -%}
  .studio3-register-shell {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* ---- Painel de marca (esquerda) ---- */
  .studio3-register-brand {
    flex: 0 0 40%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 5.2rem;
    /* Degradê com o trio de azuis da paleta 07 (ver CLAUDE.md 1.3.46/1.3.48) — mesmo
       tom médio/escuro usado na barra de frete, aqui compondo com o preto de verdade
       (#1a1a1a, mesmo tom do rodapé/logo — NÃO é --studio3-color-ink, que é um cinza
       #4c5154 usado pra TEXTO, papel diferente de "superfície escura"; usar a variável
       aqui deixava o canto inferior do degradê cinza-claro em vez de quase-preto). */
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, #3783cc 0%, transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(165deg, #1b3e69 0%, #1a1a1a 78%);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .studio3-register-brand__logo {
    display: block;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 15rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* flex:1 + justify-content:center centraliza o bloco de texto no espaço restante
     ABAIXO da logo (que fica presa no topo, primeiro item do flex-column acima) — sem
     isso (só `justify-content: space-between` no container pai, como estava antes), com
     apenas 2 filhos (logo + copy) o segundo item ia pro fim absoluto do painel de
     100vh, não pro centro. */
  .studio3-register-brand__copy {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .studio3-register-brand__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #7bacdc;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }

  .studio3-register-brand__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 3.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.22;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .studio3-register-brand__desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Painel de formulário (direita) ---- */
  .studio3-register-form-panel {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 5.2rem 3.2rem;
  }

  .studio3-register {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 43.2rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__progress {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.24rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__dot {
    /* Era width:3.2rem fixo (pill pequena) — no protótipo os dots são barras que
       dividem a largura toda do progresso em partes iguais (flex:1), não pontos
       pequenos. border-radius também volta a ser em px (4px), igual ao protótipo —
       numa barra de só 4px de altura o raio já satura no arredondamento total de
       qualquer jeito, mas mantém o valor idêntico por precisão. */
    flex: 1;
    height: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.15);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .studio3-register__dot.is-active {
    background: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
  }

  .studio3-register__step-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.44rem;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 2.4rem;
  }

  /* ---- Cards de perfil: empilhados, ícone à esquerda + conteúdo à direita (antes
     era grid 2 colunas com ícone+badge numa linha acima do título) — cabe melhor na
     coluna mais estreita do novo layout e fica mais compacto/rápido de escanear. */
  .studio3-register__cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
    background: none;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.15);
    border-radius: 1.4rem;
    padding: 1.8rem 2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .studio3-register__card:hover {
    border-color: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
  }

  .studio3-register__card.is-selected {
    border-color: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
    background: var(--studio3-color-cobalt-light);
  }

  .studio3-register__card-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4rem;
    height: 4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--studio3-color-cobalt-light);
    color: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
    transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .studio3-register__card.is-selected .studio3-register__card-icon {
    background: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .studio3-register__card-icon svg {
    width: 1.8rem;
    height: 1.8rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__card-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.08);
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
  }

  .studio3-register__card-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__card-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .studio3-register__continue,
  .studio3-register__submit {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.5rem 2.2rem;
    background: var(--studio3-color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.52rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .studio3-register__continue:hover:not(:disabled),
  .studio3-register__submit:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--studio3-color-accent-strong);
  }

  .studio3-register__continue:disabled {
    background: rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.15);
    color: rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.5);
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .studio3-register__submit.is-loading {
    opacity: 0.7;
    cursor: wait;
  }

  .studio3-register__footer-link {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
    padding-top: 2.4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.1);
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
  }

  .studio3-register__footer-link a {
    color: var(--studio3-color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .studio3-register__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .studio3-register__selected-profile {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__field {
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__field label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__field input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(76, 81, 84, 0.2);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--studio3-color-ink);
  }

  .studio3-register__field input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--studio3-color-cobalt);
  }

  .studio3-register__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  .studio3-register__error {
    background: rgba(200, 60, 60, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 60, 60, 0.25);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    color: #a83232;
  }

  /* ---- Mobile: hero escuro compacto + "folha" branca arredondada sobrepondo (ver
     comentário no topo do arquivo). A folha sobe com margin-top negativo por cima do
     hero — como vem DEPOIS no DOM, cobre a borda inferior do hero sem precisar de
     z-index. */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .studio3-register-shell {
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .studio3-register-brand {
      flex: none;
      padding: 4rem 3.2rem 8.8rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 2.4rem;
    }

    .studio3-register-brand__copy {
      /* Desfaz o flex:1 + justify-content:center do desktop (que centraliza o texto
         no espaço vertical restante) — no hero curto do mobile o conteúdo deve ficar
         empilhado no fluxo normal, não tentando ocupar/centralizar num espaço que já
         não existe (o painel aqui não tem altura fixa, é só o conteúdo). */
      flex: none;
      display: block;
      justify-content: normal;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .studio3-register-brand__title {
      font-size: 2.6rem;
    }

    .studio3-register-brand__desc {
      display: none;
    }

    .studio3-register-form-panel {
      display: block;
      padding: 0 1.8rem 4.8rem;
      margin-top: -5.2rem;
    }

    .studio3-register {
      max-width: none;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 2.2rem 2.2rem 0 0;
      padding: 3.2rem 2.2rem 0.8rem;
      box-shadow: 0 -1.2rem 2.8rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .studio3-register__row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="studio3-register-shell">
  <aside class="studio3-register-brand">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="{{ shop.name }}">
      {%- liquid
        assign dark_bg_logo = settings.logo_dark_bg | default: settings.logo
      -%}
      {%- if dark_bg_logo != blank -%}
        {%- assign logo_alt = dark_bg_logo.alt | default: shop.name | escape -%}
        {{
          dark_bg_logo
          | image_url: width: 300
          | image_tag: class: 'studio3-register-brand__logo', alt: logo_alt, widths: '150, 300'
        }}
      {%- else -%}
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 2rem; color: #fff;">{{ shop.name }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    <div class="studio3-register-brand__copy">
      <span class="studio3-register-brand__eyebrow">{{ 'studio3.register.brand_eyebrow' | t }}</span>
      <h2 class="studio3-register-brand__title">{{ 'studio3.register.brand_title' | t }}</h2>
      <p class="studio3-register-brand__desc">{{ 'studio3.register.brand_desc' | t }}</p>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main class="studio3-register-form-panel">
    <div
      class="studio3-register"
      data-studio3-register
      data-shop-domain="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}"
      data-storefront-token="{{ section.settings.storefront_access_token }}"
      data-worker-url="{{ section.settings.worker_url }}"
      data-login-url="{{ routes.account_login_url }}"
      data-error-required="{{ 'studio3.register.error_required' | t }}"
      data-error-password-length="{{ 'studio3.register.error_password_length' | t }}"
      data-error-password-match="{{ 'studio3.register.error_password_match' | t }}"
      data-error-generic="{{ 'studio3.register.error_generic' | t }}"
    >
      <div class="studio3-register__progress">
        <span class="studio3-register__dot is-active" data-step-dot></span>
        <span class="studio3-register__dot" data-step-dot></span>
      </div>
      <span class="studio3-register__step-label" data-step-label data-template="{{ 'studio3.register.step_label' | t }}">
        {{ 'studio3.register.step_label' | t | replace: '[n]', 1 }}
      </span>

      <div data-step="1">
        <h1 class="studio3-register__title">{{ 'studio3.register.step1_title' | t }}</h1>
        <p class="studio3-register__subtitle">{{ 'studio3.register.step1_subtitle' | t }}</p>

        <div class="studio3-register__cards">
          <button type="button" class="studio3-register__card" data-profile-card="profissional">
            <span class="studio3-register__card-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.5 8.5 8 10 4.5-1.5 8-5 8-10V5l-8-3Z"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="studio3-register__card-badge">{{ 'studio3.register.professional_badge' | t }}</span>
              <h2 class="studio3-register__card-title" data-profile-title>{{ 'studio3.register.professional_title' | t }}</h2>
              <p class="studio3-register__card-desc">{{ 'studio3.register.professional_desc' | t }}</p>
            </span>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="studio3-register__card" data-profile-card="cliente-final">
            <span class="studio3-register__card-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 11.5 12 4l9 7.5"></path>
                <path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="studio3-register__card-badge">{{ 'studio3.register.consumer_badge' | t }}</span>
              <h2 class="studio3-register__card-title" data-profile-title>{{ 'studio3.register.consumer_title' | t }}</h2>
              <p class="studio3-register__card-desc">{{ 'studio3.register.consumer_desc' | t }}</p>
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="studio3-register__continue" data-continue-btn disabled>
          {{ 'studio3.register.continue' | t }}
        </button>

        <div class="studio3-register__footer-link">
          {{ 'studio3.register.already_registered' | t }}<br>
          <a href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}">{{ 'studio3.register.go_to_login' | t }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-step="2" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="studio3-register__back" data-back-btn>
          ← {{ 'studio3.register.back' | t }}
        </button>
        <p class="studio3-register__selected-profile" data-selected-profile-label></p>
        <h1 class="studio3-register__title">{{ 'studio3.register.step2_title' | t }}</h1>
        <p class="studio3-register__subtitle">{{ 'studio3.register.step2_subtitle' | t }}</p>

        <div class="studio3-register__error" data-form-error hidden></div>

        <form data-register-form>
          <div class="studio3-register__row">
            <div class="studio3-register__field">
              <label for="Register-FirstName">{{ 'studio3.register.first_name' | t }}</label>
              <input type="text" id="Register-FirstName" name="first_name" autocomplete="given-name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="studio3-register__field">
              <label for="Register-LastName">{{ 'studio3.register.last_name' | t }}</label>
              <input type="text" id="Register-LastName" name="last_name" autocomplete="family-name">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="studio3-register__field">
            <label for="Register-Email">{{ 'studio3.register.email' | t }}</label>
            <input type="email" id="Register-Email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
          </div>
          <div class="studio3-register__row">
            <div class="studio3-register__field">
              <label for="Register-Password">{{ 'studio3.register.password' | t }}</label>
              <input type="password" id="Register-Password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required>
            </div>
            <div class="studio3-register__field">
              <label for="Register-PasswordConfirm">{{ 'studio3.register.password_confirm' | t }}</label>
              <input type="password" id="Register-PasswordConfirm" name="password_confirm" autocomplete="new-password" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="studio3-register__submit" data-submit-btn>
            {{ 'studio3.register.submit' | t }}
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'studio3-register.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Studio3 - Cadastro",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "storefront_access_token",
      "label": "Storefront API access token",
      "info": "Token público (não é o token de Admin) — gerado uma vez via Admin API."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "worker_url",
      "label": "URL do Cloudflare Worker (setup B2B)",
      "info": "Deixe em branco até o deploy do Worker (ver Studio3-B2B-Worker/README.md) — até lá o cadastro funciona normalmente, só sem atribuir o catálogo profissional."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Studio3 - Cadastro"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
